      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "For combined groups, work with totals: group average × group size.\n\nTo recover a ratio from two group means H and L and combined mean M:\nhigh group : low group = (M−L):(H−M).\n\nUse that ratio to find counts or percentages when needed.",
